{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Tempo Territory Strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/extras/b05ac18fa8e3f06854b6f522fe429c30.avif?t=1770734289\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/extras_big/b05ac18fa8e3f06854b6f522fe429c30.avif?t=1770734289 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers move on their own, and each round wraps up in just a few minutes. Build various structures, earn money, and grow your population to expand your territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Deck-Building!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/extras/2a721b11307e270719472278749ab7a0.avif?t=1770734289\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/extras_big/2a721b11307e270719472278749ab7a0.avif?t=1770734289 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck-building roguelike where every playthrough unfolds differently. Combine diverse synergies and craft your unique build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxed Asynchronous Battles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete casually with players worldwide in asynchronous matches. Will you impose your own build, or adapt to your opponent's deck? The way you fight is up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream and post videos of gameplay, regardless of your affiliation or whether you monetize your content. No prior contact is necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2858880?t=1770734289","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2