1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck-building roguelike where every playthrough unfolds differently. Combine diverse synergies and craft your unique build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxed Asynchronous Battles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete casually with players worldwide in asynchronous matches. Will you impose your own build, or adapt to your opponent's deck? The way you fight is up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream and post videos of gameplay, regardless of your affiliation or whether you monetize your content. No prior contact is necessary.</p>","developers":["INVISIBLE GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/3a5b0ec82e728c782dbfdf5b54261dc50015bfe1/header.jpg?t=1770734289","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2858880/620787330/fdb5430026b7f5bd31e54032f688091678e14cff/1750948136/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749267751","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2858880/620787330/fdb5430026b7f5bd31e54032f688091678e14cff/1750948136/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749267751","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2858880/620787330/fdb5430026b7f5bd31e54032f688091678e14cff/1750948136/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749267751","id":257125982,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125982/fc768d3ecdc9e5291618150ef2f181